name: sim.getVector2Property
description: Fetches a vector2 property (double[2])
luaSynopsis: list propertyState = sim.getVector2Property(int target, string propertyName, dict options = {})
pythonSynopsis: float[2] propertyState = sim.getVector2Property(int target, string propertyName, map options = {})
inputs:
1. target: target item
2. propertyName: property name
3. options: an optional map. Set options.noError to true for silent errors
outputs:
1. propertyState: property value
